OL,3,GNEWSAWhy has strike action closed
OL,4,ANorwich Airport?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorwich Airport has been closed due to
OL,7,Findustrial action by air traffic
OL,8,Fcontrol staff, causing disruption to
OL,9,Fhundreds of passengers. But how did it
OL,10,Fget to this point, what are union
OL,11,Fmembers unhappy with and what does it
OL,12,Fmean for people travelling?
OL,14,FAir traffic control members of the
OL,15,Funion Prospect voted in favour of
OL,16,Fstrike action earlier this month.
OL,18,FIt said its members were paid
OL,19,F"significantly less than the UK market
OL,20,Frate and have substandard maternity and
OL,21,Fpaternity cover", and demanded the
OL,22,Fairport make improvements.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
