OL,3,GNEWSAWhy has strike action closed
OL,4,ANorwich Airport?
OL,5,
OL,6,FStarting on 17 August, members have
OL,7,Fcommenced action short of a strike -
OL,8,Fwhich means staff work strictly to
OL,9,Fcontracts and there is no swapping of
OL,10,Fshifts or non-contractually obligated
OL,11,Fovertime.
